{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774340/extras/9c1261bbbc12dcd24df3006f8f95f935.avif?t=1759157865\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774340/extras_big/9c1261bbbc12dcd24df3006f8f95f935.avif?t=1759157865 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TSG DH ModLoader is a community-driven mod for Dread Hunger, which makes it possible to play mods. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TDM expands the boundaries of your Dread Hunger adventure with new content to be discovered, and it's all created by the Dread Hunger community! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TDM allows players to play mods, and is designed to let you play alone, with friends - one or many mods, whatever you want!\u00a0(The mods is already built into the app)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Survive the Arctic</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build fires to keep warm, fight off wolves and other predators, and hunt for food to survive the unforgiving Canadian Arctic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Betray other players</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them contaminated food, lure animals to attack them, curse them with blood magic, and if all else fails... shoot them in the back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- You are what you eat</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Arctic, you'll need to make tough choices to stay fed. Butcher carcasses and use the remains as weapons - or as food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Become a Captain</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail a 19th century warship around (or into) icebergs. Find coal for your boilers that constantly need fuel to keep the ship moving... or explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Brave the perils of the Arctic</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your time around the full day and night cycle, adapt to unexpected whiteouts, and try to survive the massive blizzard that looms over your expedition.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3774340?t=1759157865","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774340/ccd1e8b10e6a594e153999d6c50046a3b46fd69c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759157865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774340/f1214b2e1dbc3313960893286bdb782b8e7e6512/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759157865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774340/f1214b2e1dbc3313960893286bdb782b8e7e6512/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759157865","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Co-op","id":9}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"You can chop the limbs off animals and people with a sword. You can pick up severed heads / limbs and run around with them and then use them to kill other people. Sometimes dead people have willies."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774340/extras/9c1261bbbc12dcd24df3006f8f95f935.avif?t=1759157865\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774340/extras_big/9c1261bbbc12dcd24df3006f8f95f935.avif?t=1759157865 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TSG DH ModLoader is a community-driven mod for Dread Hunger, which makes it possible to play mods. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TDM expands the boundaries of your Dread Hunger adventure with new content to be discovered, and it's all created by the Dread Hunger community! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TDM allows players to play mods, and is designed to let you play alone, with friends - one or many mods, whatever you want!\u00a0(The mods is already built into the app)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Survive the Arctic</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build fires to keep warm, fight off wolves and other predators, and hunt for food to survive the unforgiving Canadian Arctic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Betray other players</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them contaminated food, lure animals to attack them, curse them with blood magic, and if all else fails... shoot them in the back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- You are what you eat</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Arctic, you'll need to make tough choices to stay fed. Butcher carcasses and use the remains as weapons - or as food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Become a Captain</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail a 19th century warship around (or into) icebergs. Find coal for your boilers that constantly need fuel to keep the ship moving... or explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Brave the perils of the Arctic</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your time around the full day and night cycle, adapt to unexpected whiteouts, and try to survive the massive blizzard that looms over your expedition.</p>","developers":["TSG Team"],"dlc":[3774970],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774340/e9077d264d79256229f9a0bdd0e3f56e0167e0ff/header.jpg?t=1759157865","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements